        "text": "Imagination becomes a field of shared ideas.\nPeople and places give those ideas a frame.\nLanguage and geometry meet across the page.\nThe contour reveals a volume through lines.\nEach measure gives the next one room to act.\nQuiet space carries the contrast and rhythm.\nThese words replace the original French.\nThe source construction remains credited.",
